# Scene catalogue renders (docs/Catalog/img/): a couple hundred KB to a
# few MB of new/changed JPEGs land here with every scene batch, forever.
# LFS from here on so the packed .git history stops growing with it --
# already-committed images are NOT retroactively migrated (that needs a
# history rewrite + force-push, a separate, explicitly-authorized step).
docs/Catalog/img/*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
